# Bubiqo needs no environment variables, and has none.
#
# This file exists to say so explicitly, because its absence would look like an
# oversight rather than a design decision.
#
# There is no API key to obtain, no account to create, no secret to manage, and
# no build-time configuration. `npm install && npm run build` is the whole setup.
#
# The one external service the product can use (Frankfurter, for currency
# conversion) requires no authentication of any kind, so there is nothing to put
# here even for that. See SERVICES.md.
#
# If you are adding a service that needs a key, read the eight rules at the end
# of SERVICES.md first.
